-- Formable Nations v0.6: City-States for formations that had no partners in the game's pool.
-- All are formation-only (Playable = 0): never drawn at random, so the game's City-State pool and trait ratios are
-- untouched. They appear only when the historical City-State setup (UI/FN_Setup.lua) swaps one in for a civ in the
-- game that needs it. Colours and art follow VP's own homeland City-States (e.g. PLAYERCOLOR_MINOR_<civ>).


-- First-contact music: the clip of a culturally close City-State, as VP does for its own additions.
